                  %em Index theory for skew-adjoint Fredholm operators
                %strong 37
                (1969) 5-26 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02684885"}> doi:10.1007/BF02684885
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.numdam.org/item/PMIHES_1969__37__5_0"} numdam:PMIHES_1969__37__5_0
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://webhomes.maths.ed.ac.uk/~v1ranick/papers/askew.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Max+Karoubi"}> Max Karoubi
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Espaces Classifiants en K-Théorie
                %strong 147
                (1970) 75-115 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/1995218"}> doi:10.2307/1995218
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/1995218"} jstor:1995218
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+K-theory"} differential K-theory
            for KO:
          %ul
            %li#GradySati18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Grady"}> Daniel Grady
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Differential KO-theory: Constructions, computations, and applications
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.07059"} arXiv:1809.07059
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aim.2021.107671"} doi:10.1016/j.aim.2021.107671
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kiyonori+Gomi"}> Kiyonori Gomi
                , Mayuko Yamashita,
                %em Differential KO-theory via gradations and mass terms
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.01377"}> arXiv:2111.01377
                )
          %p
            On the full
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+K-theory"} twisted
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+K-theory"} differential
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KO-theory"} orthogonal
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+K-theory"} K-theory
          %ul
            %li#GradySati19
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Grady"}> Daniel Grady
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              %em Twisted differential KO-theory
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1905.09085"}> arXiv:1905.09085
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %h3#for_dbrane_charge For D-brane charge
          %p
            The original observation that
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane+charge"} D-brane charge
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientifolds"} orientifolds
            should be in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KR-theory"} KR-theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KO-theory"} KO-theory
            right on the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/O-planes"} O-planes
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "#Witten98"} Witten 98, section 5
          %p and was then re-amplified in
          %ul
            %li#Gukov99
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergei+Gukov"}> Sergei Gukov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em K-Theory, Reality, and Orientifolds
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9901042"} arXiv:hep-th/9901042
            %li#BergmanGimonSugimoto01
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Oren+Bergman"}> Oren Bergman
                , E. Gimon,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shigeki+Sugimoto"} Shigeki Sugimoto
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Orientifolds, RR Torsion, and K-theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0103183"} arXiv:hep-th/0103183
          %p With further developments in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Varghese+Mathai"}> Varghese Mathai
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Murray"} Michael Murray
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Stevenson"} Daniel Stevenson
              = succeed "," do
                %em Type I D-branes in an H-flux and twisted KO-theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0310164"} arXiv:hep-th/0310164
          %p
            Discussion of orbi-orienti-folds using
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+K-theory"} equivariant
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KO-theory"} KO-theory
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                N. Quiroz,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bogdan+Stefanski"} Bogdan Stefanski
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Dirichlet Branes on Orientifolds
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0110041"} arXiv:hep-th/0110041
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Volker+Braun"}> Volker Braun
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bogdan+Stefanski"} Bogdan Stefanski
                %em Orientifolds and K-theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0206158"}> arXiv:hep-th/0206158
                )
            %li
              %p
                H. Garcia-Compean, W. Herrera-Suarez, B. A. Itza-Ortiz, O. Loaiza-Brito,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em D-Branes in Orientifolds and Orbifolds and Kasparov KK-Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0809.4238"} arXiv:0809.4238
          %p
            An elaborate proposal for the correct flavour of real equivariant K-theory needed for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orientifolds"} orientifolds
            is sketched in
          %ul
            %li#Precis
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacques+Distler"}> Jacques Distler
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dan+Freed"} Dan Freed
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Greg+Moore"} Greg Moore
              %em Orientifold Précis
              in:
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              (eds.)
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Mathematical+Foundations+of+Quantum+Field+and+Perturbative+String+Theory"} Mathematical Foundations of Quantum Field and Perturbative String Theory
              Proceedings of Symposia in Pure Mathematics, AMS (2011) (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0906.0795"}> arXiv:0906.0795
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.ma.utexas.edu/users/dafr/bilbao.pdf"} slides
        .revisedby
